entries[40767] = { ["name"] = "Sonic Booster", ["text"] = "Binds when equipped\nTrinket\n+5 Stamina\nEquip: The noise made from melee combat sometimes causes Sonic Awareness, increasing your attack power by 14 for 10 sec. This effect can only occur once every minute. (Proc chance: 35%, 50s cooldown)\nRequires Northrend Engineering (15)\nSell Price:" }
